# Base image for every FROM in infrastructure/docker/Dockerfile (CONTRACT-DECISIONS item 20): the Docker Official Image
# python:3.15.2-slim-trixie (CPython 3.15.2 on Debian 13), by index digest. This is the same pin as the website's
# lab-image/versions.env and the AddOn's infrastructure/docker/versions.env: Python 3.15 is the HCW floor
# (scripts/version-floors.json in HCW-HybridCloudWorks; moved here in HCW-HybridCloudWorks#1707). It is still moved
# by hand in this repository. The tag beside the digest is documentation; Docker resolves the digest.
# scripts/check-versions.sh (ci.yml) fails when any FROM that is not an earlier stage differs from
# PYTHON_IMAGE@PYTHON_IMAGE_DIGEST. Plain shell assignments, read by /bin/sh.
# Resolved on 2026-11-12 from Docker Hub's Docker-Content-Digest header: python:3.15.2-slim-trixie and
# python:3.15-slim-trixie both pointed at this index digest, the one the website and the AddOn pin. Re-resolve with
# docker buildx imagetools inspect python:3.15.2-slim-trixie before the next move.
PYTHON_IMAGE=python:3.15.2-slim-trixie
PYTHON_IMAGE_DIGEST=sha256:65a65fc7b30b06cb6df4930fd4650697cb23f4c2698ab81fc87e4b031bc36928
PYTHON_VERSION=3.15.2
